'''Pest Repellent''' is an {{Uncommon}} item.

== Obtaining ==
'''Pest Repellent''' can be purchased from [[SkyMart]] for {{copper|15}}.

== Usage ==
'''Pest Repellent''' can be consumed to reduce [[Pest]] spawn rates by {{Green|2x}} for {{Green|60}} minutes. It does not reduce {{stat|Bonus Pest Chance}}.

Upon consuming, it gives the player the Pest Repellent I potion effect.

